.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/56/Videoplayback_0001325565ms.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230412073555","caption":"Mametchi Глаза в молочном костюме широко открыты.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/56/Videoplayback_0001325565ms.png/revision/latest?cb=20230412073555"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:C1fc8a09.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/05/C1fc8a09.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210511093509","caption":"Из альбома «Тамаптчи» · № 22","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/05/C1fc8a09.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210511093509"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:EP_009_0001332319ms.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/55/EP_009_0001332319ms.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220701162742","caption":"Кадр из серии 9 · Тамаптчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/55/EP_009_0001332319ms.png/revision/latest?cb=20220701162742"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gasp!.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6f/Gasp%21.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141031013101","caption":"Из альбома «Тамаптчи» · № 24","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6f/Gasp%21.png/revision/latest?cb=20141031013101"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:AnimeCutScreenshots-0004.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f9/AnimeCutScreenshots-0004.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20200409170158","caption":"Momotchi в Tamagotchi!","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f9/AnimeCutScreenshots-0004.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200409170158"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Adtchi_tamaptchi_girls.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a